WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.650
- All right, before we go,
(audience applauding)

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.330
I wanna share one last happy story.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:07.230
This is "What I'm Liking."
(jazz music)

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.600
Okay, so y'all can walk
down any Manhattan street

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.440
and you're sure to find
vendors hawking hotdogs, tacos,

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:15.990
halal food, like, all those NYC staples.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:17.460
Then there's this truck.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:20.460
That bright pink vision
is the Candy Zoo truck

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.860
opened up by three New
York mamas last year.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.420
And it may be even more popular

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.860
with grownups than with kids.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:26.790
I would love it.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.680
We have the owners on
the line now watching

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.970
on NBC-4 New York.

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:33.200
Say hi to Tina, Jen and Karen, everybody.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.970
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:36.820
What's up ladies?

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:40.830
So I have to ask like,
how did this get started?

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:43.040
And I'd love everything behind you.

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:44.160
- Thank you!
- Thank you so much.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.630
Well, Jen is my oldest friend.

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:46.980
Our grandparents were friends,

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.630
our parents were friends, we're friends.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:50.670
We always wanted to do something together.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:52.920
We weren't really quite
sure what that would be.

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.540
But coming out of the pandemic,

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.520
we knew it had to be something happy.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.420
- So here we are.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:58.253
Candy.

00:00:58.253 --> 00:01:00.090
We figured candy was the way to go.

00:01:00.090 --> 00:01:01.860
And our twosome became a threesome.

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:03.870
We brought in Tina as a partner,

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:08.400
and we bought a 1997 used
truck, and we had it fabricated.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.300
And here we are.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.100
This is our Candy Zoo truck.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:11.933
- Oh, I love it.

00:01:11.933 --> 00:01:13.353
And I love that you'll
also work, is it true,

00:01:13.353 --> 00:01:15.240
with Ronald McDonald House?

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:16.440
- That's right.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:18.720
We partner with the Ronald McDonald House

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:21.210
to donate candy to all the children

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:23.220
with pediatric cancer and their families

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:26.520
'cause we wanna bring some
happiness and joy into their life

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.590
and let them come up to the truck,

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:30.840
and they get to choose
their selections of candy.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:32.580
And it's the one thing that at least

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:34.140
they get to choose for themselves

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.720
since during the day they
have all these appointments

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:39.420
that they can't, you know, not go to,

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:41.370
and they have no control over that.

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:43.050
So it's really nice to
be able to give back

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:44.790
and see their smiling faces.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.590
- Oh, you're bringing
so much joy to people.

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:48.660
Thank you so much, ladies,
for joining us today.

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:49.493
This is awesome.

00:01:49.493 --> 00:01:50.700
I'm liking your post right now.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:51.720
All right?
(bell dinging)

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:52.770
- [All] Thank you!

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:53.603
- Absolutely.

00:01:53.603 --> 00:01:54.930
And that is not all.

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:56.610
Our season long partner Pilot pen,

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:58.657
makers of FriXion, the
go-to erasable pen of

00:01:58.657 --> 00:01:59.670
"The Kelly Clarkson Show,"

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:02.700
want to celebrate those
fearlessly following their dreams,

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:03.630
just like y'all.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:05.190
So they're gonna be writing a check

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:08.378
to the Ronald McDonald House
of New York on your behalf for-

00:02:08.378 --> 00:02:10.386
(all exclaiming)

00:02:10.386 --> 00:02:12.246
- Thank you so much!
(audience applauding)

00:02:12.246 --> 00:02:13.747
- Thank you so much, ladies!

00:02:13.747 --> 00:02:15.930
And thank you to all our guests this hour.

00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:19.380
Eric McCormack, Jenna
Lyons, Nzingha Prescod,

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:20.880
Julia, Amy, and Grace Potter.

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:21.713
Y'all have a great day.

00:02:21.713 --> 00:02:23.635
And if it's not, well, try and change it.

00:02:23.635 --> 00:02:24.708
(upbeat music)

